def build_prompt(document):
    return f'''You are an assistant organizing information from a legal document for educational purposes. Analyze ONLY the text below. Do not invent or assume facts. If information is unavailable, write exactly: Not mentioned in the document. Do not decide legal enforceability or provide legal advice. Be concise and use these headings: 1 Document type/title 2 Parties 3 Purpose 4 Concise summary 5 Important obligations (identify responsible party) 6 Payment terms 7 Duration/effective date 8 Termination conditions 9 Important dates/deadlines 10 Key clauses 11 Missing or unclear information.\n\nLEGAL DOCUMENT:\n{document}'''
